---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { email } from "../../data.js";
---

<Base
  title="Melaka 1511"
  description="Melaka 1511 is a turn-based strategy game set in the Melaka Sultanate, in the years before the Portuguese arrive in 1511."
  image="/img/melaka-1511.jpg"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap page">
      <span class="eyebrow moss">Games division · In development</span>
      <h1>Melaka 1511</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Turn-based strategy set in the Melaka Sultanate. You start weak after the fall of Temasek and have
        until the Portuguese arrive in 1511 to unite the peninsula.
      </p>

      <img class="wide-img" src="/img/melaka-1511.jpg" alt="Melaka 1511 early build" width="720" height="405" />

      <p class="muted">
        You use officers like Tun Perak and Hang Tuah to build the economy, raise an army and win over the
        states around you. The player trades, governs, defends and negotiates. The history is the game: 1511
        changed trade across the whole region, and almost no game has touched it.
      </p>

      <div class="facts">
        <div><span>Genre</span><strong>Turn-based strategy</strong></div>
        <div><span>Setting</span><strong>Melaka Sultanate, up to 1511</strong></div>
        <div><span>Art</span><strong>Voxel</strong></div>
        <div><span>Platform</span><strong>PC first</strong></div>
      </div>

      <h2>Publishers</h2>
      <p class="muted">We are talking to publishers now. Email for the deck and a playable build.</p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn main" href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Melaka%201511`}>Ask for the deck</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://youtu.be/4TbsJau7QmA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the video</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
